Adequacy and static validation are complete. Constructor-level program identity passed, but the ground intended result is unprovable, an opposite opaque interpretation proves a false result, and a real body mutation leaves the target proof closing. The exhaustive 1,147-record source inventory covers 727 rules and 243 syntax declarations. The fresh false mutation failed for the expected unmet postcondition.
